@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
# Для свежей БД. Иначе подставьте ID из ответов POST.
@companyId = 1
@otherCompanyId = 2
@meetingId = 1

### Health -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Managers seeded by migration -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/managers

### Create company -> 201 (synthetic BIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"ТОО Demo One","bin":"000000000101","phone":"+77010000001"}

### Create second company -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"ТОО Demo Two","bin":"000000000102","phone":"+77010000002"}

### Log unanswered call -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{companyId}},"result":"no_answer","notes":"Повторить звонок позже"}

### Filter and paginate -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?status=no_answer&page=1&pageSize=10

### Missing meeting for meeting_set -> 422 MEETING_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{companyId}},"result":"meeting_set"}

### Monday 10:00–11:00 Almaty -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{companyId}},"managerId":1,"startsAt":"2026-11-23T05:00:00Z"}

### Log meeting_set after booking -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{companyId}},"result":"meeting_set","meetingId":{{meetingId}},"notes":"Клиент подтвердил"}

### Overlapping 10:30–11:30 Almaty -> 409 MANAGER_OVERLAP
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{otherCompanyId}},"managerId":1,"startsAt":"2026-11-23T05:30:00Z"}

### Start 17:30 Almaty -> 422 (ends outside office hours)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{otherCompanyId}},"managerId":1,"startsAt":"2026-11-23T12:30:00Z"}

### Saturday -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{otherCompanyId}},"managerId":1,"startsAt":"2026-11-21T05:00:00Z"}

### Adjacent 11:00–12:00 Almaty -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{otherCompanyId}},"managerId":1,"startsAt":"2026-11-23T06:00:00Z"}

### Different manager, same company -> 409 COMPANY_ACTIVE_MEETING
POST {{baseUrl}}/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyId":{{companyId}},"managerId":2,"startsAt":"2026-11-24T05:00:00Z"}

### Monday schedule -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/managers/1/schedule?date=2026-11-23

### Reschedule the first meeting to Tuesday 11:00 -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"startsAt":"2026-11-24T06:00:00Z"}

### Original time and chronological history -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{meetingId}}

### Tuesday schedule -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/managers/1/schedule?date=2026-11-24

### Cancel -> 200; repeat is also 200 without a duplicate history entry
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"cancelled"}

### Tuesday schedule is now empty -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/managers/1/schedule?date=2026-11-24

### Cancelled meeting cannot be rescheduled -> 409 MEETING_CANCELLED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/meetings/{{meetingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"startsAt":"2026-11-25T05:00:00Z"}
